9a:["$","$L7e",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80","children":"One of the most electrifying players ever to wear the red shirt. Suárez terrorised Premier League defences with his relentless movement, invention and ruthless finishing. His 2013/14 season — 31 league goals in 33 games — almost single-handedly delivered the title before a heartbreaking final-day collapse. Left for Barcelona having become a Liverpool legend in just three seasons."}]
