9d:["$","$L7e",null,{"className":"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80","children":"The world's best goalkeeper and the final piece of Klopp's jigsaw. Alisson's £65m arrival from Roma transformed Liverpool's defensive record. He famously scored a headed goal against West Brom in 2021 to help clinch a Champions League spot. A Champions League winner in 2019 and Premier League champion in 2020 and 2025, he is widely regarded as the finest goalkeeper in the club's history."}]
9e:["$","p",null,{"className":"sr-only","children":"The world's best goalkeeper and the final piece of Klopp's jigsaw. Alisson's £65m arrival from Roma transformed Liverpool's defensive record. He famously scored a headed goal against West Brom in 2021 to help clinch a Champions League spot. A Champions League winner in 2019 and Premier League champion in 2020 and 2025, he is widely regarded as the finest goalkeeper in the club's history."}]
